Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(drilling)!: address break-through review findings

Omit through-exit notes for Spot's entry dimple. Move pure path and
depth helpers to motion, retaining document reads in app. Pin Spot,
the public domain seam, and Drill/Bore/Thread controls and units.

BREAKING CHANGE: project format v63 files are refused by older readers.
The through-hole break-through parameter requires format v63 so an
older reader cannot silently drop a stated exit allowance.

Fixes #1557
